            "value": "Please note: the actual data are available from the University of Groningen UMCG Institutional Data Access for researchers who meet the criteria for access to confidential data. The local ethics committees of the MCL and the UMCG will maintain the ethical restrictions of the data. The Data Protection Officer of the UMCG will maintain the legal restrictions and appropriate codes of conduct. Permission is required prior to access. Data requests can be sent to Research Data Office University of Groningen: researchdata@rug.nl."
